  m_GameObject: {fileID: 777344166}
  m_Text: 'Make one Double Shot Flat White.

    1  Follow the order ticket on your left.

    2  Touch whatever the yellow marker floats over.

    3  Grip (left mouse on desktop) grabs and presses.

    4  Your shot report appears on your right.

    Station panel, top left: move, reset, credits, exit.'
